# Forever game-type TOC. The client loads this instead of AuctionHouseTricksForever.toc
# when it still recognizes the Camelot suffix. Same addon either way.
# The wiki said this suffix may be renamed at launch; the unsuffixed file
# is the fallback and declares the same interface number.
## Interface: 16001
## Title: Auction House Tricks Forever
## Notes: Auction House tweaks for Forever: hide preview tooltips from the Filter menu, optionally close the Dressing Room with the auction house, and dim bag items that cannot be posted on the Sell tab.
## Author: Auction House Tricks Forever
## Version: 2.0.0
## SavedVariables: AuctionHouseTricksForeverDB
## Category: Auction & Economy
